s12::bwborrow |- ( ( ( A e. ZZ /\ B e. ZZ /\ C e. 2o ) /\ I e. NN0 ) -> ( ( borrow ( A bwFold B ) C ) ` I ) = if ( ( A mod ( 2 ^ I ) ) < ( ( B mod ( 2 ^ I ) ) + ( bToNat ` C ) ) , 1o , (/) ) )
